    "description": "This course equips students with knowledge of the C/C++ programming language from basic to advanced,\n*) Basics\n- C/C++ Keywords, C/C++ Variable Types, Lvalues and Rvalues, Operators in C/C++, Strings, Arrrays, Pointerts, C/C++ References, C/C++ Basic Input/Output ...\n- OOP\n*) Advance:\nC/C++ Standard Template Libaries, Files/streaming ,Exception, template, multithread, smartpointer, etc.\n*) Skill:\nProblem-solving thinking skills, logical thinking and technical communication skills in the direction of Computational Thinking (CT).",
    "studentTasks": "- Students must attend at least 80% of contact slots in order to be accepted to the final examination.\n- Student is responsible to do all exercises, assignments and labs given by instructor in class or at home and submit on time\n- Students apply Computational Thinking (CT) to analyze, model, and present solutions to problems\n- Use laptop in class only for learning purpose\n- Promptly access to the FU FLM at https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/ for up-to-date course information",
